      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/1109.png",
      "text": "ካብ ዕለታት ሓደ መዓልቲ፡ ወትሩ ውላድ ትብህግ ሰበይቲ ትነብር ነበረት።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=51337#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:1507a6a55bc57f95c76cca9a374a29c116412f6858abb311bd686ec17d116a60"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": null,
      "text": "እዛ ሰበይቲ ዝበለጸ ዋላኻ ኣናደየት እሞ፡ ጓል ድማ ኽትጥፍጥፍ ጀመረት።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=51337#page=2",
